ic Reliability Corporation (NERC) CIPS CIP 006-3c, A, B, R1, R1.6</Paragraph><Paragraph FontStyle="Normal" FontSize="12">NRC Cyber Security Programs for Nuclear Facilities Regulatory Guide 5.71 C.3.3.1.1, App. B.1.1</Paragraph></FlowDocument>')
', NULL, N'Administrative-2.4.6', N'2.4.6', N'Visitor Records', N'Visitor Records', N'The organization maintains visitor access records to the control system facility (except for those areas within the facility officially designated as publicly accessible) that include:

a) Name and organization of the person visiting.
b) Signature of the visitor.
c) Form of identification.
d) Date of access.
e) Time of entry and departure.
f)  Purpose of visit.
g) Name and organization of person visited.
Requirement Enhancement - The organization employs automated mechanisms to facilitate the maintenance and review of access records.', N'Designated officials within the organization review the access logs after close-out and periodically review access logs based on an organization-approved frequency.

