', NULL, N'Administrative-2.4.9', N'2.4.9', N'Emergency Power', N'Emergency Power', N'The organization provides a short-term uninterruptible power supply to facilitate an orderly shutdown of noncritical control system components in the event of a primary power source loss.
Requirement Enhancement 1 - The organization provides a long-term alternate power supply for the system that is capable of maintaining minimally required operational capability in the event of an extended loss of the primary power source.
Requirement Enhancement 2 - The organization provides a long-term alternate power supply for the system that is self-contained and not reliant on external power generation.', N'This control may be satisfied by similar requirements fulfilled by another organizational entity other than the control system security program. Organizations should avoid duplicating actions already covered.

', NULL, N'The organization provides a short-term uninterruptible power supply to facilitate an orderly shutdown of noncritical control system components in the event of a primary power source loss.

', NULL, N'1. The organization provides a long-term alternate power supply for the system that is capable of maintaining minimally required operational capability in the event of an extended loss of the primary power source.
2. The organization provides a long-term alternate power supply for the system that is self-contained and not reliant on external power generation.
