', NULL, N'Administrative-2.4.12', N'2.4.12', N'Temperature and Humidity Controls', N'Temp/Hum Controls', N'The organization regularly monitors the temperature and humidity within facilities containing control system assets and ensures they are maintained within acceptable levels.', N'This control may be satisfied by similar requirements fulfilled by another organizational entity other than the control system security program. Organizations should avoid duplicating actions already covered.

', NULL, N'The organization regularly monitors the temperature and humidity within facilities containing control system assets and ensures they are maintained within acceptable levels.

