', NULL, N'Administrative-2.4.13', N'2.4.13', N'Water Damage Protection', N'Wtr Damage Protect', N'The organization protects the control systems from damage resulting from water leakage by ensuring that master shutoff valves are accessible, working properly, and known to key personnel.
Requirement Enhancement - The organization implements automated mechanisms to close shutoff valves and provide notification to key personnel in the event of a water leak within facilities containing control systems.', N'This control may be satisfied by similar requirements fulfilled by another organizational entity other than the control system security program. Organizations should avoid duplicating actions already covered.

