oleum Institute Pipeline SCADA Security Standard API 1164 2nd Edition Annex B.4.1.2</Paragraph><Paragraph FontStyle="Normal" FontSize="12">North American Electric Reliability Corporation (NERC) CIPS CIP 002-3 through CIP 009-3, D</Paragraph><Paragraph FontStyle="Normal" FontSize="12">NRC Cyber Security Programs for Nuclear Facilities Regulatory Guide 5.71 C.3.3.3.2, C.4.1, C.4.1.1, C.4.1.2, C.4.1.3</Paragraph></FlowDocument>')

