</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 27, 23, NULL, NULL, 711, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Are stakeholders notified when they are affected by changes to assets?', N'<div class="sub-header-2">Implemented</div>
