</ul>
')
<ul>
<li>Sources for identifying control objectives may be found in governance documents, policy documents, etc.</li>
</ul>
</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 33, 23, NULL, NULL, 721, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Have controls been implemented to achieve the control objectives established for the critical service?', N'Criteria for “Implemented" Response
<ul>
