')
</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 34, 23, NULL, NULL, 721, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Have controls been implemented, incorporating network segregation where appropriate, to protect network integrity?', N'<div class="sub-header-2">Implemented</div>
