')
</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 35, 23, NULL, NULL, 722, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'As a result of the controls analysis, are new controls introduced or existing controls modified to address gaps?', N'<div class="sub-header-2">Implemented</div>
