<li>The organization sets the assessment schedule.</li>
<li>The organization should consider regulatory obligations and internal policy for performance and scheduling requirements.</li>
</ul>
</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 36, 23, NULL, NULL, 722, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Is the performance of controls assessed on a scheduled basis to verify they continue to meet control objectives?', N'<div class="sub-header-2">Implemented</div>
