</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 42, 23, NULL, NULL, 725, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Are events detected and reported (to include cybersecurity events related to personnel activity, network activity, the physical environment, and information)?', N'<div class="sub-header-2">Implemented</div>
