 Incident analysis should determine whether the incident has legal ramifications.
</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 47, 23, NULL, NULL, 726, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Are incidents analyzed to determine a response?', N'<div class="sub-header-2">Implemented</div>
