</div>', NULL, NULL, 1, 94, 24, NULL, NULL, 808, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Does the plan or policy identify and describe external dependencies management processes?', N'<div class="sub-header-2">Implemented</div>
