</ul>
<div><p><b>Criteria for “Incomplete” Response:</b></p></div>
<ul>
<li> Management oversight covers some aspects of the day-to-day change management activities.</li>
</ul>', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 4, NULL, NULL, 439, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, N'', N'', N'', N'', NULL, NULL, NULL)

<ul>
<li> Funding is an indication of higher level management support and sponsorship of change management activities.</li>
