<ul>
<li> The intent is to determine risks that prevent the organization from performing change management activities (change management process), not the risks to the organization if the activities are not performed.</li>
</ul>

<div><p><b>Risks to consider in relation to the change management process include:</b></p></div>
<ul>
<li> poorly defined change management processes</li>
<li> inadequate staffing</li>
<li> inadequate funding</li>
<li> unqualified staff</li>
<li> lack of tools</li>
<li> lack of a documented plan, policy, standards, and guidelines</li>
<li> lack of stakeholder involvement</li>
<li> lack of management oversight</li>
</ul>

<div><p><b>Criteria for “Yes” Response:</b></p></div>
